From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:24:48 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] add shell, sync daemon, and virtual keyboard
 (overlay/asteroidos)

Package the core AsteroidOS userland services on top of the middleware
layer:

- asteroid-launcher: Wayland compositor and touch smartwatch shell
- asteroid-btsyncd: Bluetooth LE synchronization daemon
- virtualkeyboard: on-screen touch keyboard with watch styling

Add the Nemo.Configuration QML plugin and the upstream libhybris
hwcomposer QPA plugin the launcher needs, and pin the launcher to the
current nightly.
